com/godotengine/godot/pull/104768.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-30T14:06:55Z"},"body":"Fixes #104763\r\n\r\nWhen a pixel value is less than -1.0 `log2(blockMax + 1.0f)` becomes undefined causing the behavior. This PR attempts to fix the behavior by using a custom log function that is effectively a reflection of the x > 0 side:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a5a8d792-949f-45d3-abf7-c43936cc5e1a)\r\n\r\nIt seems to fix the problem without any side affects. I also tested if it might improve the quality mode, but it had no effect there.\r\n\r\nMaster:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4558da10-150b-4a21-a857-3aa71adcc480)\r\n\r\nPR:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0bf78486-b9d0-444c-8dc2-cbcb7b3bd9f2)\r\n\r\n\r\nMRP: [signed-bc6h.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19521822/signed-bc6h.zip)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104768/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket"